@startuml 17_activity_forecast_pipeline
!include _style.iuml
title Activity Diagram (3/3) — Operational forecasting pipeline (D10, chapter 18)\n<<designed; artifact not trained yet>>

|Data preparation|
start
:extract authorized immutable snapshot\n(scope, cutoff, hash);
:validate uniqueness, timezone,\ncurrency, units, completeness;
:aggregate to DAY / WEEK / MONTH;
note right: missing intervals stay unknown,\nnot zero
:build lag and shifted rolling features\n(no target leakage);
:chronological split train → validation → test;
|Training & validation|
fork
  :naive baseline;
fork again
  :seasonal-naive / moving average;
fork again
  :XGBoost candidate;
fork again
  :LSTM (optional);
end fork
:time-aware error metrics on same periods;
if (candidate beats baselines\nand passes gate?) then (yes)
  :store ModelArtifact(VALIDATED,\nmodel + data hash);
else (no)
  :ModelArtifact stays CANDIDATE\nor RETIRED;
  |Inference|
  :forecast_sales returns MODEL_NOT_READY;
  stop
endif
|Inference|
:Analytics agent calls forecast_sales\n(owner only, horizon ≤ limit);
:ForecastRun(PENDING → SUCCEEDED / FAILED)\nwith provenance;
:grounded report: predicted ≠ actual,\nno guarantee wording;
stop
@enduml
